  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Tooke</defName>
    <label>tooke</label>
    <description>Tooke were small, hopping rodents native to the planet Naboo. They were nocturnal by nature and like all rodents, the tooke had a high reproductive rate and they generally fed on nuts and berries. They were a common pest animal that spread readily to many worlds including Stoga, where predators like the worrt would gorge themselves immobile consuming them. Even a carnivorous plant (the so-called the 'tooke-trap') had evolved to target these creatures by emitting it's mating pheremone; however the rodents were usually agile enough to escape.</description>
